<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TOSHACK IN TALKS WITH BESIKTAS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOSHACK IN TALKS WITH BESIKTAS.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Deportivo Coruna boss John Toshack was due in Istanbul on Tuesday for talks about coaching Besiktas, the Turkish club said.</p>
<p>The ex-Liverpool and Wales international quit Deportivo in February after an unsuccessful run in the Spanish league and cup and clashes with the club's directors, players and fans.</p>
</text>
